    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;This programme for two pianos and percussion features three of the most beloved and popular works of the repertoire: Bernstein’s West Side Story, an unsurpassed masterpiece of musical theatre; George Gershwin’s iconic American in Paris, a romantic symphonic poem with jazzy undertones; and Mussorgsky’s stunningly original, powerful and intense Pictures at an Exhibition. This vibrant... &lt;a class=&quot;read-more&quot; href=&quot;https://tuckamorefestival.ca/event/bergmann-duo-with-bill-brennan-etienne-gendron/&quot;&gt;Read&nbsp;More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
