      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Canada’s finest string quartet plays Beethoven’s transcendent Quartet op. 131 on a program with works by Prokofiev and Mozart.  The New Orford String Quartet -  four elite orchestral leaders and soloists who perform chamber music together at the highest level - has been described by the The Toronto Star as “nothing short of electrifying.” The... &lt;a class=&quot;read-more&quot; href=&quot;https://tuckamorefestival.ca/event/new-orford-quartet/&quot;&gt;Read&nbsp;More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
