        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Meghan Lindsay, soprano, Carson Becke, piano and special guest, Annie Corrigan, oboe, present an extraordinary concert of exquisite opera arias and lied including Strauss\\'s Four Last Songs.  Meghan Lindsay has performed regularly with Opera Atelier, Pacific Opera Victoria, and Tafelmusik, and appeared in venues such as Amsterdam’s Concertgebouw, Toronto’s Koerner Hall, and the Royal Opera... &lt;a class=&quot;read-more&quot; href=&quot;https://tuckamorefestival.ca/event/conversations-with-the-past-works-by-mozart-and-strauss/&quot;&gt;Read&nbsp;More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
