        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Our six Young Artist chamber groups will receive feedback and mentorship from members of the New Orford Quartet following live performances. These masterclasses will take place at the Memorial University School of Music (D.F. Cook Recital Hall, Suncor Energy Hall, Choral Room, Chamber Studio) and are open to the public.&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
