        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Acclaimed New York musicians Serena Canin, Brentano Quartet, and Dov Scheindlin, Metropolitan Opera Orchestra, team up with Tuckamore Faculty (and old friends) in this magical evening of music by Haydn, Jason Noble, Joan Tower, Dvorak, and Schumann. This concert will be followed by a post-concert interview with the artists. &nbsp; Dvořák: 4 Miniatures Op. 75a... &lt;a class=&quot;read-more&quot; href=&quot;https://tuckamorefestival.ca/event/monuments-and-miniatures/&quot;&gt;Read&nbsp;More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
